window.products.push({"id":739127,"name":"KEVA Boho Table Runner 72inches Long with Hand-Made Wooden Beads Tassel, Farmhouse Rustic Vintage Embroidered White Table Runners 13x72 Inch for Dinin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TCMMMhb1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"80% Polyester 20% Linen [Material] – This elegant table runner is made of two layers of high-quality fabric. The front layer is heavyweight textured 80% Linen and 20% polyester fiber, and the back layer is glossy 100% polyester fiber. Using two layers of fabric will make this table runner more durable and luxurious. [Size] -- 13x72 inch Table Runner (not include the length of tassels), Sold as 1 piece. It’s suitable for most tables and cabinets to add a warm farmhouse look to any dinner or kitchen table. [Unique Design] -- This brilliant table runner is exquisite boho pattern design with chain embroidery by white thread to make the pattern vividly and delicately. Using unique textured linen fabric exudes farmhouse charm, and neutral color gives it a natural, country look to bring a touch of rustic appeal to any kitchen or dining room table. Also add one hand-made wooden tassels on each corner of table runner to give it a warm, earthy and elegant look. [Decoration Occasions] – This vintage table runner is perfect for home kitchen dining table decorations for everyday use, party and holidays. It also would be a good gift when family and friends gathering, holiday celebrations. [Easy to wash] -- Machine wash cold separately in gentle cycle with like colors. Use only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry low. Cool iron as needed. Wrinkles are unavoidable with 80% linen material given the low elasticity of flax plant fibers. We suggest to spot clean the smudge and dry flat, use a steam iron on low heat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TCMMMhb1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KEVA","source_asin":"B0BRSN8PB3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-739127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRSN8PB3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRSN8PB3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
