window.products.push({"id":739270,"name":"VEVOR Dumpling Steamer Stainless Steel 5 Titer for for Cook Soup, Noodles, Fishes Work with Gas Electric Grill Stove Top, Dia 30cm/11.8inch, Pot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lLDebPX7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Heavy-Duty Stainless Steel Material: Constructed from food-grade 304 stainless steel (0.02\"/0.58 mm thick), with polished mirror surface, the dumpling steamer is of high thermal conductivity and efficient heating. It is sanitary, durable, and not easy to deform. 5-Tier Large Capacity for Delicious Foods: 5-tier capacity provides enough space to cook much food. The total capacity is up to 38.5 Qt, and the bottom layer can hold up to 7.9 Qt capacity. The other three layers also have a large capacity of 6.3 Qt respectively, which can accommodate your various ingredients at one time. Larger than traditional stockpot steamers, perfect for big gatherings, and commercial kitchens. Compatible with Multiple Stoves: The bottom of the steam pot is made of 3-layer composite material, making it superbly energy-efficient, so it cooks evenly without hot spots. It is suitable for most stoves, including gas stoves, induction cooker, electric ceramic stoves, halogen stoves, etc. Heightened Lid & Convenient Handles: The dome-shaped lid allows steam to re-circulate, reaching all tiers, featuring 3.7-inch height for larger cooking space. The visible pot lid made of tempered glass allows for easy observation of the internal food. The evenly distributed steam holes boost the throughput of steam and prevent steam water from accumulating. The sturdy riveted handles keep cool and facilitate convenient food-taking. Various Combinations for Space Saving: It can be a steamer for foods, a stockpot for soups, and the steamer pot can double as a colander for straining and washing foods. The steamer for cooking can be separated into five different pots (4-Tier/3-Tier/2-Tier/Single-Tier Steamer, Stock Pot), to meet your different demands. The proper stacking will provide you larger storage space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lLDebPX7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOR","source_asin":"B08G4QWQZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-739270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G4QWQZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G4QWQZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
