window.products.push({"id":739416,"name":"DAVID ROCCO Handheld Fan with 5000 mAh Large Capacity, 2022 upgrade Small Personal Fan with 3 Speeds Neck Fan Rechargeable Portable Fan, Good for Trav","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SMdPkrY1S._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【4 in 1 Design small fan with Power Bank】: Handheld fan , Desktop Fan and Neck Fan as a mobile phone holder . DAVID ROCCO handheld fan with 5000mAh power bank comes to solve this problem for you. 4 in 1 design brings convenience for girls, boys, sporters, teenagers, office workers, and so on. You can charge your phone, simultaneously enjoy the cooling air. Worthy to own one. 【Three-Speed Adjustment& 5000mAh Long Working Time】: Portable Neck Fan One-key control of wind force, simple operation. The wind is divided into three different wind speeds: low / medium / high, so you can control the wind as you like.After fully charged, the 1st to 3rd gears can last for about 20 hours, 14hours and 7 hours respectively. Long battery life, lasting cool. 【Strong Wind & Ultra Quiet and USB Powered】: Personal Fan Using the brushless motor and 7 fan blades, which can gather more airflow and generate stronger wind, moreover it can work more stablely than the others, so you can enjoy a cool and quiet journey. It’s extremely convenient to use as you can get power source such as USB adapter, power bank. So you could take it as a desk fan, personal fan. 【180° Rotatable Fan and Portable Lightweight Design】: The small USB fan supports 180° rotation makes you get airflow from different directions so that keep you cool in any angle. Mini handheld fan is only the size of the palm. Using a portable folding design, it will not take up too much space and weight when putting it in a backpack. Even in your pocket is a breeze. 【SATISFACTION GUARANTEE】Your satisfaction is our top priority. We guarantee the quality of our products and want you to be completely satisfied with your purchases. If for any reason you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, you can get a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SMdPkrY1S._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DAVID ROCCO","source_asin":"B0923VRVYF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-739416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0923VRVYF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0923VRVYF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
