window.products.push({"id":739476,"name":"Kalmateh Yerba Mate Set – Mate Gourd with Lid, Alpaca Bombilla, Thermos, Matera Carry Tote and Organic & Kosher Yerba Mate (Wood, 1000ml)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y71R1o2yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MODERN THERMOS: This organic mate set includes a premium quality BPA-Free mate thermos made with 18/8 food grade stainless steel for an authentic mate experience! With double walled vacuum insulation and thermal copper lining, this thermos keeps outside heat or cold from transferring inside. Thermos includes precision pouring, retractable spout for easy pouring into the gourd. Comes completely apt for easy cleaning by hand. Not dishwasher or microwaveable safe. INNOVATIVE GOURD: This quality yerba mate gourd is made with premium quality 18/8 food grade stainless steel. Capable of holding 8z with no heat loss or transfer thanks to its double walled vacuum and thermal copper lining, it is the perfect gourd for all your mate needs. Its BPA-Free clear lid allows for comfortable travel. Easy to clean by hand. Not dishwasher or microwaveable safe. ALPACA BOMBILLA: This yerba mate bombilla is hand-made from the highest quality alpaca steel from our talented artisans in Argentina that allows for an improved experience for our mate lovers. It’s made from corrosion-resistant nickel-silver alloy, and it is lightweight, smooth and beautifully crafted with a removable filter head for easy cleaning with an elegant, high quality finish. MODERN TOTE BAG: Take your yerba mate experience on the go with our Kalmateh yerba mate bags made out of eco-friendly, recyclable and washable material. These Matera Bags are first of its kind! Comes with two main pockets designed to carry your thermos or wine bottle and your accessory items. Take the Kalmateh experience anywhere you go in style! GUARANTEED QUALITY SERVICE: Our customer's satisfaction is our main priority. If you are not entirely satisfied or have questions regarding our products, please contact us so we can answer your concerns!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y71R1o2yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kalmateh","source_asin":"B08MFPVJBT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-739476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MFPVJBT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MFPVJBT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
