window.products.push({"id":739553,"name":"CO2 Refill Adapter Filling Tank Adapter Soda Bottle Adapter Connector Adapter Accessories(CGA320 to TR21.4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RFbj+vVwL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Feature: 1. Good sealing performance, no gas leakage when connected to the cylinder, more convenient to use. 2. The connector can easily inject carbon dioxide into the water bottle, which is simple in operation and practical. 3. Made of high quality brass material, it is durable, wear-resistant and can be used for a long time. 4. It is a very practical accessory with exquisite workmanship and excellent performance. 5. It can be used with large CO2 tank with CGA320 connector, or DIN477 / W21.8-14 connector, JIS m22-14 CO2 tank valve.   Specification:  Condition: 100% Brand New Item Type: CO2 Refill Adapter Material: Brass Type: W21.8 to TR21.4, CGA320 to TR21.4 (Optional) Weight: Approx. 167g / 5.9oz Height: Approx. 4.7cm / 1.9in  Operating Instructions: 1. Screw the adapter onto the commercial carbon dioxide cylinder 2. Screw CO2 of air cylinder into adapter 3. Open the atmospheric bottle valve 4. After about 15 to 20 seconds, the cylinder is full 5. Close the atmospheric bottle valve 6. Open the vent screw to discharge the residual gas. 7. Remove the carbon dioxide produced by the cartridge    Package List:  1 x CO2 Refill Adapter 3 x Gasket","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RFbj+vVwL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fdit","source_asin":"B0821CL2FY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-739553","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0821CL2FY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0821CL2FY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
