window.products.push({"id":739630,"name":"Meeting & Market Fig Rhubarb Candle - Soy Wax Scented Candle - Long Burning Candle for Men or Women - Premium Fragrance Candle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618I-4-ZS0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Soy Wax SCENT NOTES: Far too few have experienced the flavor burst of fresh figs - notes of strawberry, currant, and blackberry with a depth and character all its own. We've balanced the sweetness with tart notes of rhubarb to create an unusually sophisticated take on a spring and summer fragrance. MANUFACTURER: Meeting & Market Soy Wax Candles are based in Charleston, SC. From wicking the glassware to labeling the box, we are still a hands on, hand crafted product. Over the years, we have poured nearly 10,000 candles. We like to think practice makes perfect. BURN TIME: These 16oz candles will burn for a minimum 60 hours. We recommend burning them until completely liquified across the top to avoid tunneling. Take a look at our insert for a few other helpful hints. ECO-FRIENDLY & SOY WAX - This candle is made with naturally biodegradable and eco-friendly soy wax. It is paraben and cruelty free! LONG LASTING, DURABLE, & RECYCLABLE: Our candles have some of the longest burn times on the market. Our heavy duty glassware is extremely tough, and can be recycled for storing cotton balls, Q-tips, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618I-4-ZS0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meeting & Market","source_asin":"B072YXKTGP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-739630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072YXKTGP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072YXKTGP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
