window.products.push({"id":739686,"name":"ICONIQ Qlassic 20 ounce Stainless Steel Insulated Tumbler Mug with Built-in Handle and Splash Proof Lid | Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DKJhj8U2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DOUBLE WALLED VACUUM INSULATION: Keep your cold drinks COLD for up to 12 hours and hot drinks HOT for up to 6 hours in our 20 ounce insulated mug! Keep your hands sweat-free and dry instead of burning or freezing. EASY TO GRIP HANDLE: Our minimalist handle design allows you to hang on to your coffee cup no matter what you are doing, while still designed to comfortably fit into most car cup holders. 18/8 STAINLESS STEEL: Take a swig out of our tumblers without fear of toxic chemicals! We only use 18/8 food grade stainless steel. PRESS ON LID: With an easy to clean, BPA-FREE press-on lid, you can travel with your mug anywhere. The non-toxic silicone o-rings and mouthpiece cover keeps your mug spill proof. LIFETIME GUARANTEE: We invite you to try our insulated mug RISK-FREE for 30 days! ALL ICONIQ products are back by a Limited Lifetime Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DKJhj8U2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICONIQ","source_asin":"B092LJFJ66","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-739686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092LJFJ66","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092LJFJ66","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":739687,"name":"Weston Marinade Injector, 1 ounce Capacity, Plastic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YFYsq5fdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Weston marinade injector, 1 Ounce is easy to use, simply insert needle into marinade, draw back injector to fill, then slide the needle into the meat. Inject your favorite flavored herbs, butter, sauces or marinades under the skin of any Wild game or turkey, beef, pork, chicken or even fish for added flavor and juicy moisture. The ergonomically designed crank handle turns effortlessly and it disassembles for easy cleaning. Dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YFYsq5fdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Weston","source_asin":"B000ZMFEAY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-739687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000ZMFEAY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000ZMFEAY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":739688,"name":"iDesign Weston Medium Metal Hanging Shower, Bath Organizer Holds Shampoo, Razors, Conditioner, Soap, Over-The-Door Caddy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vP7AEycoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Organize your shower with the design Weston Shower Caddy! This hanging caddy is placed over any shower door for additional storage. The rust-resistant satin finish adds a classic look and will stay looking new for years of quality use. The two metal wire racks allow for water drainage while storing your shampoos, soap, body wash, shaving cream, and other bath items in the two storage baskets. It features a non-slip shower hooks to keep the caddy secure in place. Measuring 14. 45\" x 8. 74\" x 24\", you are sure to have space for all of your bath time necessities in the design Weston Shower Caddy. With design by InterDesign, you can #Live Simply every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vP7AEycoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iDesign","source_asin":"B07Y2MGX77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-739688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y2MGX77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y2MGX77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
