window.products.push({"id":739750,"name":"Naomi Home Brenda Glam Beaded Framed Leaner Mirror Beaded Full Length Mirror Wooden Frame Bathroom Mirror 66\" x 32\" Large Framed Decor Wall/Floor Mirr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":125.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MkHn2arML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEAUTIFUL BEADED MIRROR: This 66\"x32\" full length huge mirror standing is ideal for adding more utility to a wall or floor while enhancing the space of a room, making it feel larger and lighter. The silver floor mirror full length has a faux wood frame, which will be sturdy and long-lasting, while the panels are clear xl mirror with a slight bevel, giving it more texture and shape. SOPHISTICATED LOOK: The full body huge mirrors for bedroom is simple and modern design gives this oversize mirrors for floor a sophisticated look that makes it a perfect accent piece for any room. Elegant beading in a Silver finish. Beautiful inlaid beading between beveled mirror panels. ERGONOMIC DESIGN: Crafted with a durable frame, this beaded standing mirror not only looks elegant, but it is built to last. The frame was handmade with care and attention, adding a genuine and warm feel to beautify your home. VERSATILE DESIGN: This huge floor mirror full length can be placed in a wide array of locations and positions, making it adaptable for any style of room. Hooks are pre-installed in the backboard of this beaded big mirror. This xl floor mirror is easy to install and can be hung horizontally or vertically. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Our long mirrors for bedroom is packed in several strategic layers to minimize the risk of damaging the product during transport. Our Proprietary Packaging ensures the safe delivery of the oversize mirror to your home. All our Mirrors come with a 90 Day Manufacturer's Warranty, and in the unlikely event that you are not happy with our product, you can contact our customer service for a return/refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MkHn2arML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Naomi Home","source_asin":"B0C33Y1BF9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-739750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C33Y1BF9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C33Y1BF9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":739751,"name":"Personalized I Love Tap Ornament Dangling Shoes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KUjHZm4VL._AC_.jpg","description":"The tap dancer in your life will dance with delight when she sees this dazzling, dangling personalized ornament on her tree Christmas morning! Whether it's her first time taking tap dancing lessons or her 100th time, she will just love this three-piece, two sided decoration featuring the letter \"I\" heavily glittered with crimson red glitter, a white heart outlined in shimmering glitter from which a pair of tap shoes dangles. One of our professional writers will beautifully customize this \"I Love Tap\" ornament with a name and year to create a darling keepsake for the tapper on your gift list.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KUjHZm4VL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rudolph and Me","source_asin":"B00ALHSBDK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-739751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ALHSBDK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ALHSBDK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":739752,"name":"Contigo AUTOSEAL Spill-Proof Stainless Steel VacuumTravel Mug 14oz with Easy-Clean Lid, 2 Pack (Bubble Tea/Stainless)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51s+KvlaKCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Hectic mornings are easier with the 14 oz. Pinnacle Stainless Travel Mug, because this mug features a one-touch AUTOSEAL lid that automatically seals between sips to prevent spills. This double-wall vacuum-insulated mug is engineered to keep drinks hot for up to 4 hours or cold for up to 12 hours, without a sweat. We mean that literally because this vacuum-insulated mug keeps your drink at the optimal sipping temperature and eliminates condensation for dry hands. The AUTOSEAL lid creates an easy one-hand drinking experience and it fits most standard car cup holders, which makes it ideal for the commute! We passionately urge parents, teachers, commuters, or anyone on-the-go the loves a hot drink, to grab this mug!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51s+KvlaKCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Contigo","source_asin":"B09LRP6VB5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-739752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LRP6VB5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LRP6VB5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":739753,"name":"Santa Claus Helicopter Pilot Glass Christmas Ornament 5 Inches Long","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fleRWJnZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3.5 Inches Tall X 5 Inches Long 8.8 cm Tall x 12.7 cm Long Glass Hand Painted Mouth Blown Life-like Rotating Metal Propeller Gift Boxed Transportation ornaments are a unique and festive way to decorate for Christmas. From hand-painted glass balls featuring Santa Claus flying an airplane to miniature cars and trains, these ornaments add a touch of whimsy to any holiday display. Transportation-themed ornaments are also a great way to commemorate a special trip or journey. Whether you're looking for a fun gift for a fellow traveler or a festive addition to your own holiday decor, transportation ornaments are sure to please. Each of our ornaments is meticulously crafted by hand using traditional techniques that originated in the 1800's. The Renaissance-era carving, molding, glass blowing, silver lining, painting and finishing processes require unparalleled skill and several weeks to complete. The molten glass is mouth-blown into finely carved molds to shape the ornament. It is then painted and glittered in a series of labor-intensive steps to achieve the beautiful final products. Exquisite workmanship and details are the hallmark of all BestPysanky ornaments. We aim to bring warmth, color, spirit and sparkle into your home with our unique decor, as you admire and celebrate the holidays with your loved ones. It's more than just an ornament- it's a work of art!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fleRWJnZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestPysanky","source_asin":"B015MA4R6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-739753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015MA4R6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015MA4R6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
